<event_program>
  <metadata>
    <event_title>
      <zh>2026 Miami Harvest Moon Festival</zh>
      <en>2026 Miami Harvest Moon Festival</en>
    </event_title>
    <theme>
      <zh>天涯共此时</zh>
      <en>Together Under One Moon</en>
    </theme>
    <program_type>
      <zh>舞台演出节目单</zh>
      <en>Stage Performance Program</en>
    </program_type>
    <date_time>
      <date>2026-10-03</date>
      <day_of_week>Saturday</day_of_week>
      <time>1:00–3:00 PM</time>
    </date_time>
    <venue>
      <location>Miami Dade College Wolfson Campus</location>
      <hall>Auditorium</hall>
    </venue>
    <description>
      <zh>一轮明月，从中国的诗歌、舞蹈与戏曲升起，照进迈阿密年轻人的歌声，最后让不同文化在同一个舞台相遇。</zh>
      <en>One moon carries us from Chinese poetry, dance, and opera to the voices of Miami’s young people—and brings our cultures together on one stage.</en>
    </description>
  </metadata>

