        <performance number="6">
          <title>
            <zh>京剧《霸王别姬》选段</zh>
            <en>Farewell My Concubine — Peking Opera Excerpt</en>
          </title>
          <performers>
            <performer>
              <zh>乔丽</zh>
              <en>Qiao Li</en>
            </performer>
          </performers>
          <performer_bio>
            <zh>乔丽毕业于中国戏曲学院明星班，是著名京剧表演艺术家关素霜的嫡传弟子，曾获全国首届京剧大奖赛金奖。她曾作为《卧虎藏龙》相关奥斯卡金像奖颁奖晚会的特邀演出嘉宾，并参加林肯中心纪念梅兰芳大师访美80周年的演出。</zh>
            <en>Qiao Li graduated from the Star Class at the National Academy of Chinese Theatre Arts and is a direct disciple of renowned Peking Opera artist Guan Suoshuang. She won a Gold Award at the inaugural National Peking Opera Grand Prix. She was an invited performer at the Academy Awards ceremony associated with Crouching Tiger, Hidden Dragon and appeared in a Lincoln Center tribute marking the 80th anniversary of Mei Lanfang’s visit to the United States.</en>
          </performer_bio>
        </performance>
        <special_feature type="interactive">
          <title>
            <zh>京剧传承互动</zh>
